# Shared sources materialized into this plugin.
#   <path under shared/>  ->  <path under this plugin>
#
# Destinations are per-skill: a SKILL.md resolves bundled paths relative to its own folder.
# The same script is also copied into the reasoning plugin, so both skills check one file format
# from one source.
#
# Regenerate with: python3 tools/materialize.py

scripts/requirements/requirements.py -> skills/split-epics/scripts/requirements.py
